{"id":"wb-7-1033","name":"周宣灵王庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"周宣灵王庙","text":"周宣灵王庙又名孝子庙，位于中国浙江省衢州市柯城区下营街18号，始建于南宋，是为纪念孝子周雄而建。相传周雄在母亲去世时因为过于哀伤，哭泣而死。现存建筑是明代重建，清代重修，建筑面西向，由门厅、正殿和后殿组成。1997年8月29日，列入浙江省文物保护单位，2013年5月，列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%91%A8%E5%AE%A3%E7%81%B5%E7%8E%8B%E5%BA%99","revisionId":90844237,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90844237","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/dc9a85f47dfacef5f11ec1d5.jpg","title":"Quzhou Zhouxuanlingwang Miao 2011.06.26 16-10-27.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Quzhou_Zhouxuanlingwang_Miao_2011.06.26_16-10-27.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/59/Quzhou_Zhouxuanlingwang_Miao_2011.06.26_16-10-27.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"浙江省衢州市周宣灵王庙 ——大门","width":320,"height":213,"matchEvidence":"对应百科配图的名称与所在地一致"}}